t/issues/124336","id":6102530949,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa707hQ","user":{"login":"GDevSh007","id":247660653,"node_id":"U_kgDODsMAbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247660653?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007","html_url":"https://github.com/GDevSh007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T21:48:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T21:48:38Z","body":"I tested the build and can confirm that it does also fixes the issue: #122741 .\r\nJust before tumbling into this PR I was working out a solution myself! Because I thought the issue didn't drew much attention for the maintainers to work on it! What a coincidence 🙃. Anyway that solution was nothing like this and involved hack to let the engine ask the hardware for its maximum UBO limit at startup, and dynamically shrinks the #define MAX_GLOBAL_SHADER_UNIFORMS in the shader code. But this PR is overall a better closing to wide range of other similar issues while abandoning UBOs for global shader parameter to pack all global shader variables into data texture.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6102530949/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"perfor