creen recorder seems to not able to record multiple layers of window so I had to record the game window separately) \r\n4.7.2~\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aabf9981-8819-4160-9aa2-5bf40fc3f4c0\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e82b0e6-4a7a-48f0-a166-a5a6ffc3aa44\r\n\r\n\r\n4.8 PR build~\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbf84b75-27cc-4eb3-8315-a0c3e47e7679\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22ba7033-9458-440d-96f8-1fde3faa2e41\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6116010801/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6146987111","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124336#issuecomment-6146987111","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124336","id":6146987111,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbmOUZw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type"